# Campaign output joins the repository once, complete, with the reports it
# supports. Per-unit checkpoints are resume state and are fully reproduced by
# run_outputs in A.json/B3.json, so they stay local; the raw provider capture
# is kept because it is what makes a reported number auditable.
docs/evaluation_*/checkpoints/
docs/evaluation_*/*.writing
!docs/evaluation_*/progress.jsonl
!docs/evaluation_*/provider_responses.jsonl
